router B:
  1. POST /system/backup/save {"name":"mtha-pre-apply"}
       pre-apply backup of router b
  2. PUT /ip/firewall/nat {"action":"accept","chain":"srcnat","comment":"nat-vpn","place-before":"*9"}
       create nat-vpn (from router a), placed before masquerade
  3. PUT /ip/firewall/nat {"action":"accept","chain":"srcnat","comment":"nat-lab","place-before":"*9"}
       create nat-lab (from router a), placed before masquerade
